# Canonical author identities.
#
# This repository was developed across two git configurations, so the same
# person appears under two spellings — differing in the diacritic and in the
# capitalisation of the address. Without this file GitHub counts them as two
# contributors.
#
# A .mailmap corrects how identities are displayed (git log, git shortlog,
# git blame, and GitHub's contributor graph) without rewriting any commit, so
# no hashes change and provenance is untouched.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> <commit@email>

Niklas Norén <niklas.noren@who-umc.org>
Niklas Norén <niklas.noren@who-umc.org> <Niklas.Noren@who-umc.org>
